<item><title>Libya and US discuss trade council plan and market-entry obstacles</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-and-us-discuss-trade-council-plan-and-market-entry-68a051/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-and-us-discuss-trade-council-plan-and-market-entry-68a051/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>Officials reviewed the Trade and Investment Framework Agreement and ways to ease American companies’ entry into Libya’s market.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:27:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" length="30956" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Libya launches U.S. partnership programme covering oil, energy and transport</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-launches-u-s-partnership-programme-covering-oil-279e42/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-launches-u-s-partnership-programme-covering-oil-279e42/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>The plan also includes mining, infrastructure investment and technology transfer, while the Libyan delegation is due to seek agreements and implementation timelines.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:17:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" length="30956" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Libyan Iron and Steel links rising rebar prices to its production halt</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-iron-and-steel-links-rising-rebar-prices-to-its-08fdae/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-iron-and-steel-links-rising-rebar-prices-to-its-08fdae/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>The company says it is working to increase the quantities of rebar available in the local market, which it hopes will bring prices back to stability.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:18:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-iron-and-steel-links-rising-rebar-prices-to-its-08fdae/share.jpg" length="43238" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-iron-and-steel-links-rising-rebar-prices-to-its-08fdae/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
